{"version":1,"content":"<p>海關昨日（28日）在火炭搗破3個私煙儲存倉，共檢獲約120萬支私煙及約70萬支另類吸煙產品，估計市值約800萬元，應課稅值約400萬元。</p><p>行動中，3名介乎29至37歲的男子被捕，其中一人已被落案起訴，另外兩人正被扣查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:41:30.798409+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:34:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:18:14.015260+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.594069+00:00","content_hash":"e8443fcf2ac31d3f840ea467496a9d53e57123b760eb6de705183a6c11fcc3e2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}